; AurumFlow MT5  -  PRESET v09  -  2026-09-19  -  BITCOIN
; v04's logic on BTCUSD. v04 itself is untouched.
; Distances are NOT guessed: they are v04's distance as a fraction of
; price, re-applied at BTC's median price of 88,288 (measured over
; 1,033,202 M1 bars, 2024-09 -> 2026-09):
;   SL   2100 = 0.5695%% of price -> 50281
;   TP   1800 = 0.4882%%          -> 43098
;   PD     30 = 0.0081%%          ->   718
; The spread gate could NOT be rescaled the same way. A proportional
; MaxSpreadPoints would be 718, but BTC's MEDIAN spread is 1694 and its
; 99th percentile is 1894 - the gold value of 30 blocks BTC outright,
; which is exactly what the live chart showed: 'Spread High (1695>30)'.
; So MaxSpread is set from the distribution: 2000 admits 99%% of minutes.
; Separate magic (60701122) so BTC trades never mix with gold's.
; NOT RUN yet.
;
;
;

;
